    "description": "Pine Gate Renewables was a U.S. developer and owner-operator of utility-scale solar and storage projects. Founded in 2016, it received a US$500 million growth-and-asset financing commitment from Generate Capital in 2022 and a US$650 million investment involving Generate, HOOPP and HESTA in 2024. Pine Gate entered Chapter 11 in November 2025. Five sale transactions transferred development, operations and project packages between January and April 2026; the liquidation plan became effective on April 22, 2026 and cancelled all existing equity. The historical integrated-platform record is therefore realized. MorningSky Power, ACT Power Services and the separate project-buyer businesses are not treated as continuations of this record.",
